From 943bbd7f5c66dc6bd04de05683661b4e9292c0a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Nov 2025 12:15:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: stm32: change gpio bank clocks to scmi ones on
 stm32mp15

In stm32mp15 "scmi" device trees, change gpio bank clocks to scmi ones.

Signed-off-by: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I553b68580173492b78ef26721a3b321e5c609270
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/511850
